    "created_at": "2023-01-31T09:41:03Z",
    "updated_at": "2023-01-31T09:41:03Z",
    "body": "[Spaceship registry](https://spaceship-prompt.sh/registry/) is like [Hexo plugin](https://hexo.io/plugins/) search page, it make it easy to share and search for plugins. While each starship plugin/custom section would have it's own git repository it would make it easier to add new custom commands by just adding the plugin name to a plugin array in the configuration rather than having to browser a github thread mixed up with comments and manually copy-pasting plugin content that won't be updated through time unless you come back visiting the github thread often to monitor changes and copy-pasting again.",
